  "idea": "Stirling-PDF: 100 percent free open-source PDF power tool",
  "text": "This free open-source tool gives you every premium PDF feature with zero limits. Freelancers often spend hours splitting giant invoices, converting scanned receipts, and manually redacting client addresses. Most online converters throttle file sizes or inject ugly watermarks unless you upgrade to paid tiers. Stirling-PDF lets you merge, split, password-protect, and convert hundreds of documents in seconds offline. You eliminate expensive software licenses while keeping your documents secure.",
